===== Open up and connect cable =====

General explanation:
  * [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial|Serial]]
  * [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial.cables|Serial cables]]
\\
  - Remove the two screws on the bottom side of the device \\ {{:media:arcadyan:arv752dpw:arcadyan-arv752dpw_bottom_case.jpg?400|}}
  - Open the front cover e.g. with plastic tools (guitar picks, ...) \\ Some plastic clips of the front cover will probably brake \\ {{:media:arcadyan:arv752dpw:arcadyan-arv752dpw_front_with_plastic_guitar_picks.jpg?400|}} \\ {{:media:arcadyan:arv752dpw:arcadyan-arv752dpw_front_cover.jpg?400|}}
