  - Connect the USB to TTL serial adapter to the serial header
    - The serial header is located in the middle of the PCB
    - 3 cables need to be connected, GND, TX and RX **(do not connect any 3.3V or 5V)**
    - Pin 1 is marked with a small arrow near the serial header
    - Serial connection speed is 115200 Baud 8N1
    - Pin out <code>
